Arpa llanera, cuatro, maracas, restrained dub-techno drum programming, rounded kick, mono sub-bass, short analog chord stabs, tape echo, spring or plate reverb, euphonium or bass trumpet, occasional handclaps, foot taps, and room microphones capturing the wooden-floor response.

