Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Twelve Steps Before the Kick Returns
Story & Context: The opening track begins with Damián tapping twelve quiet pulses on the wooden floor while Lucía plays a repeating harp figure that emphasizes four groups of three. Mateo enters with a dub-techno kick that suggests three groups of four instead, making the same cycle feel suddenly squared off without altering tempo. Inés waits four complete cycles before adding muted cuatro strokes on pulses four, eight and twelve.

The central section removes the kick entirely. Harp, cuatro and maracas continue the groove so clearly that the absent electronic pulse remains perceptible. Mateo then returns not on pulse one but on pulse ten, allowing two beats of apparent instability before the full twelve-pulse alignment becomes obvious again. A single euphonium note appears only in the final cycle, held underneath the last harp descent.

